    "sub_name": "企業永續轉型個案分析",
    "sub_ename": "CASE ANALYSIS OF ENTERPRISE SUSTAINABLE TRANSFORMATION",
    "describe_ch": "使用個案分析與討論方式，引導學生瞭解企業面臨極端氣候風險、友善環境、社會共融及優化公司治理等當代重要議題對企業經營所造成的營運挑戰。並為降低地球環境風險與企業轉型，設計可持續發展的創新行動方案。",
    "describe_eh": "Using case analysis and discussion methods, students are guided to understand the operational challenges posed to business operations by important contemporary issues such as extreme climate risks, environmental friendliness, social inclusion, and optimization of corporate governance. In order to reduce global environmental risks and develop corporate transformation program, this course guides students to design innovative action plans for sustainable development.",
